      "kind": "required_all",
      "text": "Required Courses (39 units) Note: Must complete CMPE 195A / CMPE 195B and ENGR 195A / ENGR 195B with C or Better to meet GE Area requirements. CMPE 70 - Assembly Language Programming 3 unit(s) CMPE 110 - Electronics for Computing Systems 4 unit(s) CMPE 125 - Digital Design 4 unit(s) CMPE 126 - Algorithms and Data Structure Design 3 unit(s) CMPE 127 - Microprocessor Design I 3 unit(s) CMPE 131 - Software Engineering I 3 unit(s) CMPE 140 - Computer Architecture and Design 3 unit(s) CMPE 142 - Operating Systems Design 3 unit(s) CMPE 146 - Real-Time Embedded System Co-Design 3 unit(s) CMPE 148 - Computer Networks I 3 unit(s) Senior Design: CMPE 195A - Senior Design Project I 2 unit(s) (GE UD Area 4 / Formerly Area S) CMPE 195B - Senior Design Project II 3 unit(s) (GE UD Area 3 / Formerly Area V) ENGR 195A - Global and Social Issues in Engineering 1 unit(s) (GE UD Area 4 / Formerly Area S) ENGR 195B - Global and Social Issues in Engineering 1 unit(s) (GE UD Area 3 / Formerly Area V)",
